  "prefLabel": "We 302.08 Loss of Qualified Individual",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "We 302.08 Loss of Qualified Individual. A licensed water well construction or pump installation business shall:\n\n(a) Notify the board within 30 days of the death, withdrawal, or change of employment of a qualified individual; and\n\n(b) Not construct any water wells or install any pumps until another licensed individual takes the position of the withdrawn or deceased individual and is designated as the qualified individual for the business licensee.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for We 300) #12083 eff 3-1-17",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/we100-1000.html"
